OL,3,GNEWSAFringe celebrates record-breaking
OL,4,Aticket numbers for a single day
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record number of people attended
OL,7,Fshows on a single day at this year's
OL,8,FEdinburgh Festival Fringe, according to
OL,9,Forganisers.
OL,11,FThe Fringe Society ` which oversees the
OL,12,Funcurated festival ` said it notched up
OL,13,Fthe highest attendance for a single
OL,14,Fday, on the second Saturday in August.
OL,16,FMore than 164,000 tickets were issued,
OL,17,Fwhich was 1% higher than the previous
OL,18,Fpeak on Saturday 17 August 2019.
OL,20,FOverall, it issued 2.8 million tickets
OL,21,Ffor shows during this year's event - an
OL,22,F8% increase on last year.
